"id": "37624416227173417"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "473446950850318"}]}, "change_log": "This update was again focused on improvements to endodontics procedures. Notable changes:\n\u2022\tChanges to feedback/evaluation for several tools, including major changes to master cone, endo files, and apex locator.\n\u2022\tEndo files now have meaningful taper, so hand files and rotary files of the same ISO size will produce different cuts.\n\u2022\tRework of the endo file debris system: debris now accumulates dynamically and will cause the file to move slower in the canal.\n\u2022\tScene scale can now be changed in procedures, allowing you to make models larger or smaller.", "created_date": 1786044617, "id": "37624416227173417", "version": "1.86", "version_code": 1722, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}